},
"1_1": {
"dialogue": "RAWR xd",
"offset": Vector2(-1500, -300),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": ""
},
"1_10": {
"dialogue": "Aqua's experiments are just in this room here.",
"offset": Vector2(-1760, 3440),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_11": {
"dialogue": "Well, you should probably get used to it.",
"offset": Vector2(2480, 880),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_40",
"text": "Why's that?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_5",
"text": "I guess I'll try..."
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 290),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_12": {
"dialogue": "If you like this, I have something interesting to show you. Follow me!",
"offset": Vector2(2488.15, 1201.49),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_4",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_13": {
"dialogue": "Hmm, well this isn't very peaceful... But its important to learn, so bear with me. Sorry.",
"offset": Vector2(-1760, 1560),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_14",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_14": {
"dialogue": "To start, click the Attacks button, then select the [el]Green[/el] attack. [br][br]Press Space when you've done so.
",
"offset": Vector2(-1340, 1480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_15",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_15": {
"dialogue": "Great! Now hover your mouse over the enemy.  
[br][br][b]Space[/b]",
"offset": Vector2(-1000, 1480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_18",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_16": {
"dialogue": "I think Aqua left a few of his experiments up ahead.",
"offset": Vector2(-2260, 1100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_3",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_17": {
"dialogue": "Ack!",
"offset": Vector2(-1580, 1100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_2",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_18": {
"dialogue": "Now what you're seeing is called the [i]transmutation hint[/i]. It might not make much sense, but that's okay. 
[br][br]Just remember that the top-right square is [el]cyan[/el].
[br][br][b]Space[/b]",
"offset": Vector2(-660, 1480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_19",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_19": {
"dialogue": "Now click on the enemy and press the \"End Turn\" button below.",
"offset": Vector2(-340, 1480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_2": {
"dialogue": "",
"offset": Vector2(-1500, -620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": ""
},
"1_20": {
"dialogue": "",
"offset": Vector2(-2260, 4040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_21": {
"dialogue": "My attack channeled the elemental power of [el]Green[/el], which reacted with the opponent's [el]Blue[/el] typing to create [el]Cyan[/el].",
"offset": Vector2(-2200, 2160),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_22",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_22": {
"dialogue": "What's more, these reactions have side effects! Elements are broken into 2 subgroups: [color=blue]Defensive[/color] and [color=red]Offensive[/color].
",
"offset": Vector2(-1860, 2160),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_24",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_23": {
"dialogue": "When you go from:
[ul][color=blue]Defensive[/color] -> [color=blue]Defensive[/color] = Speed boost.[/ul]
[ul][color=red]Offensive[/color] -> [color=red]Offensive[/color] = Speed boost.[/ul]
[ul][color=red]Offensive[/color] -> [color=blue]Defensive[/color] = Defense boost.[/ul]
[ul] [color=blue]Defensive[/color] -> [color=red]Offensive[/color] = Attack boost.[/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-840, 2160),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_26",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_24": {
"dialogue": "Defensive Types:
[ul][el]Blue[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Cyan[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Magenta[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Yellow[/el][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-1520, 2160),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_25",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_25": {
"dialogue": "Offensive Types:
[ul][el]Green[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Purple[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Orange[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Red[/el][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-1180, 2160),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_23",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_26": {
"dialogue": "Press [i]T[/i] to pull up the Transmutation Menu. The second tab contains the type chart. Hover over any of the squares will show you that combos side effects.",
"offset": Vector2(-500, 2160),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_27": {
"dialogue": "Now I have 2 more things to show you.",
"offset": Vector2(-2180, 2460),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_28",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_28": {
"dialogue": "You probably noticed that I have 2  colors, while the opponent only has 1.",
"offset": Vector2(-1840, 2460),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_29",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_29": {
"dialogue": "The first 2 rows of a transmutation hint shows how those 2 types will react to an attack.",
"offset": Vector2(-1500, 2460),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_41",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_3": {
"dialogue": "Are you okay?!",
"offset": Vector2(-880, 180),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_30",
"text": "I think so"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": "I'm good, how are you?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 290),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_30": {
"dialogue": "Good, because I don't have a first aid kit on me.",
"offset": Vector2(-540, 180),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_33",
"text": "What is this place?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"4_1",
"text": "Where am I?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 290),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_31": {
"dialogue": "Right, sorry. I've been solely around researchers for the past few months. I may have forgotten how to talk to normal people.",
"offset": Vector2(800, 200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_34",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 257),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_32": {
"dialogue": "Well, the general consensus is that w're in some sort of ephemeral sub-space, recessed away from reality. ",
"offset": Vector2(140, 180),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"4_3",
"text": "It looks like a beach..."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"4_2",
"text": "That makes sense"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 290),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_33": {
"dialogue": "*Gathers thoughts*",
"offset": Vector2(-200, 180),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_32",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_34": {
"dialogue": "We're on the Southern-most beach of an island. There's a research station North of here and not much else for miles.",
"offset": Vector2(1140, 200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_35",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_35": {
"dialogue": "Luckily for you, there should be a supply boat coming in a few days. It can take you back to the mainland.",
"offset": Vector2(1480, 200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([{
"cur_variable": 2,
"operator": 0,
"value1": "introduction_state",
"value2": "smart"
}]),
"link": &"1_36",
"text": "Is that how you get back to reality?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_9",
"text": "Is the mainland this blue too?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 291),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_36": {
"dialogue": "Well, no... sorry. We're not really sure how, or even if, that can be done.",
"offset": Vector2(1820, 240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_37",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_37": {
"dialogue": "I know that must be disappointing...",
"offset": Vector2(2160, 240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_38",
"text": "Not really"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"4_6",
"text": "A little..."
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 290),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_38": {
"dialogue": "Oh, well in that case you might really like it here.",
"offset": Vector2(2800, 240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_40",
"text": "What makes you say that?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 257),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_39": {
"dialogue": "I'm sorry. But this place isn't all bad.",
"offset": Vector2(2800, 540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_40",
"text": "Yeah?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 257),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_4": {
"dialogue": "There should be a slime around here somewhere...",
"offset": Vector2(-2260, 800),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_2",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_40": {
"dialogue": "It might be easier to show you. Follow me.",
"offset": Vector2(3200, 760),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_4",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_41": {
"dialogue": "You may have guessed what the 3rd row is hinting to you, but if not watch how my typing reacts to the opponent's next attack.",
"offset": Vector2(-1158.54, 2484.62),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_42": {
"dialogue": "So not only will your typing react to your opponent's attacks (and vice versa), but your primary and secondary types can react together!",
"offset": Vector2(-2180, 2760),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_43",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_43": {
"dialogue": "Finally, just one more thing.
[br][br]So far, we've only been using [i]ranged[/i] attacks. Watch what happens when the opponent uses a melee attack instead.",
"offset": Vector2(-1840, 2760),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_44": {
"dialogue": "But more importantly, using a ranged attack will only affect your opponent's typing. However, melee attacks will affect both the target and the user.",
"offset": Vector2(-1820, 3080),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_45": {
"dialogue": "",
"offset": Vector2(-2260, 3740),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_46": {
"dialogue": "If your second type is Gray (Blank), it will change to match the attack you used.",
"offset": Vector2(-2160, 3080),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_44",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_5": {
"dialogue": "...",
"offset": Vector2(2840, 1100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_7",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_6": {
"dialogue": "THUD",
"offset": Vector2(-1540, 180),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": ""
},
"1_7": {
"dialogue": "As much as I don't want to, I should probably give you the Forlorn crash course. Follow me.",
"offset": Vector2(3220, 1060),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_4",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_8": {
"dialogue": "You know what? This works too.",
"offset": Vector2(-1760, 1860),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_14",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_9": {
"dialogue": "What? I mean part of it is, I guess",
"offset": Vector2(1820, 560),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"4_4",
"text": "Hopefully not *this* blue..."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"4_5",
"text": "Its kinda peaceful"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 290),
"speaker": 0
},
"2_1": {
"comment": "Objectives for intro:
- Segue into transmutation system.
- Introduce monster?",
"offset": Vector2(-1540, 500),
"size": Vector2(420, 220)
},
"2_2": {
"comment": "The second option here is a subtle 
reference to the fact that there is currrently 
nothing on the mainland.",
"offset": Vector2(1480, 60),
"size": Vector2(340, 120)
},
"2_3": {
"comment": "[ul]When a [color=blue]defensive element[/color] transmute into another [color=blue]defensive element[/color], they get a speed boost.[/ul]
[ul]The same goes for when a [color=red]offensive element[/color] transmutes into another [color=red]offensive element[/color].[/ul]
[ul]When a [color=red]offensive element[/color] transmutes into a  [color=blue]defensive element[/color], they get a defensive bonus.[/ul]
[ul] When a [color=blue]defensive element[/color] transmutes into a  [color=red]offensive element[/color], they get an offensive bonus.[/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-1276.8, 1922.8),
"size": Vector2(200, 100)
},
